// Plays straight baseball on both sides: deliver a straightaway changeup
// (a unit-tested called strike) once the steal window shuts, and commit a
// dead-red swing as the pitch reaches the plate. The Swing action is
// style-aware: the same script grades through Classic, Swing Meter, and
// PCI because the director synthesizes the input pattern each adapter
// expects.
Script(
    name: "balanced",
    rules: [
        (when: All([OnDefense, Phase(PrePitch), Not(InStealWindow)]), then: Press),
        (when: All([OnOffense, Phase(Pitch), PlateEta(early_ms: 0.0)]), then: Swing),
    ],
)
